ate":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T17:49:19Z","url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/releases/download/v1.7.12/actionlint_1.7.12_linux_arm64.tar.gz"},{"apiUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/releases/assets/384924879","contentType":"application/gzip","createdAt":"2026-03-30T17:49:17Z","digest":"sha256:ae4a0a5227578e66f5d00ee02788d5c64fdae1fa6484ab88ceaeee9359c28fa4","downloadCount":590,"id":"RA_kwDOFhfz284W8XzP","label":"","name":"actionlint_1.7.12_linux_armv6.tar.gz","size":2206296,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T17:49:17Z","url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/releases/download/v1.7.12/actionlint_1.7.12_linux_armv6.tar.gz"},{"apiUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/releases/assets/384924910","contentType":"application/zip","createdAt":"2026-03-30T17:49:19Z","digest":"sha256:cdc8643b2c8dc890c76ad16095da97e75f86572805cc3573cc13f31ea0f19127","downloadCount":4504,"id":"RA_kwDOFhfz284W8Xzu","label":"","name":"actionlint_1.7.12_windows_386.zip","size":2350848,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T17:49:19Z","url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/releases/download/v1.7.12/actionlint_1.7.12_windows_386.zip"},{"apiUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/releases/assets/384924919","contentType":"application/zip","createdAt":"2026-03-30T17:49:19Z","digest":"sha256:6e7241b51e6817ea6a047693d8e6fed13b31819c9a0dd6c5a726e1592d22f6e9","downloadCount":637229,"id":"RA_kwDOFhfz284W8Xz3","label":"","name":"actionlint_1.7.12_windows_amd64.zip","size":2479065,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T17:49:20Z","url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/releases/download/v1.7.12/actionlint_1.7.12_windows_amd64.zip"},{"apiUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhysd/actionlint/releases/assets/384924915","contentType":"application/zip","createdAt":"2026-03-30T17:49:19Z","digest":"sha256:cadcf7ea4efe3a68728893813643cebe1185e5b1d4be5b96245f65c9a4d5ea41","downloadCount":16090,"id":"RA_kwDOFhfz284W8Xzz","label":"","name":"actionlint_1.7.12_windows_arm64.zip","size":2200159,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-03-30T17:49:20Z","url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/releases/download/v1.7.12/actionlint_1.7.12_windows_arm64.zip"}],"body":"- Support the [`timezone` configuration in `on.schedule`](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/workflow-syntax#onschedule) with checks for IANA timezone string. See the [documentation](https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/blob/main/docs/checks.md#check-cron-syntax-and-timezone) for more details. Note that actionlint starts to embed the timezone database in the executables from this version so the binary sizes slightly increase. (#641, thanks @martincostello)\r\n  ```yaml\r\n  on:\r\n    schedule:\r\n      # ERROR: The timezone is not a valid IANA timezone string\r\n      - cron: '*/5 * * * *'\r\n        timezone: 'Asia/Somewhere'\r\n  ```\r\n- Support the [`jobs.<job_name>.environment.deployment` configuration](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/how-tos/deploy/configure-and-manage-deployments/control-deployments#using-environments-without-deployments). (#639, thanks @springmeyer)\r\n- Support the [`macos-26-intel` runner label](https://github.blog/changelog/2026-02-26-macos-26-is-now-generally-available-for-github-hosted-runners/). (#629, thanks @hugovk)\r\n- Fix the outdated [table of webhook activity types](https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/blob/main/all_webhooks.go) by rebuilding the [script to scrape the table](https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/tree/main/scripts/generate-webhook-events) from scratch.\r\n- Support Go 1.26 and drop the support for Go 1.24. Now supported versions are 1.25 and 1.26.\r\n- Tests are run on arm64 Windows in CI.\r\n- Update the popular actions data set to the latest.","tagName":"v1.7.12","url":"https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint/releases/tag/v1.7.12"}
